      <ol>
        <li>Install <b>Node.js 22 or newer</b> from nodejs.org. Check with =
<code>node --version</code>.</li>
        <li>Install <b>Git</b>. Check with <code>git --version</code>. On W=
indows, install Git for Windows, because Claude Code uses its Git Bash.</li=
>
