i>
        <li>Make your studio folder and open Claude Code in it:<br><code>mk=
dir my-email-studio</code> =C2=B7 <code>cd my-email-studio</code> =C2=B7 <c=
ode>git init</code> =C2=B7 <code>claude</code></li>
      </ol>
